OL,3,GNEWSAFarage vows to scrap tax on armed
OL,4,Aforces reserves
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Reform UK, Nigel Farage,
OL,7,Fhas told a rally in Plymouth he would
OL,8,Fget rid of tax on pay for armed forces
OL,9,Freservists.
OL,11,FFarage said he wanted to get more
OL,12,Fpeople in the reserves at the event for
OL,13,Fparty supporters as part of Reform's
OL,14,F100 Days to Save Britain tour.
OL,16,FWhen questioned by the BBC over a
OL,17,FReform councillor in Plymouth who was
OL,18,Finvestigated and cleared over social
OL,19,Fmedia posts, Farage said he was "still
OL,20,Fpart of the party was because everyone
OL,21,Fbelieves he's a solid bloke".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
