OL,3,GNEWSAFarage vows to scrap tax on armed
OL,4,Aforces reserves
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 100 protesters against Reform
OL,7,Fgathered outside the Plymouth Arena
OL,8,Fnear the city centre, chanting before,
OL,9,Fduring and after the event.
